WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.810
Papika?

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:15.140
Mimi!

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.440
Who are you?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.330
You were a big girl before,

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.460
an old lady before that,

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.070
and a baby before that.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:07.510
Now...

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:11.090
you're the same as me.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:16.720
I'm Cocona.

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.160
And you?

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.030
Dunno.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:21.720
Don't you remember?

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.680
No.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:23.990
Nothing.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:32.510
Feel better now?

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.390
A little.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.990
I'll stay with you until you're all better.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.130
It won't be lonely if we're together.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:41.850
Really?

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:42.790
Yeah.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.080
Then...

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.000
Please!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.540
Be friends with me!

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:52.680
Sure.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:38.970
Cocona!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.390
H-Hey!

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:41.680
Stop that, Papika!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.170
What?

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:46.320
But you said you love, love, <i>love</i> me!

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.950
Th-That was...

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.950
Those two...

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.460
really don't play fair.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.710
How dare you defy your mother...

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.960
Children belong to their parents!

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.510
Mom.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:25.830
We did it!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.150
No way.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.120
Bad girls must be punished.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.290
Mom will give you a good spanking...

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:43.380
and I won't stop until 
you become a good girl.

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:50.670
Cocona...

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.230
Cocona...

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:56.440
My Cocona, and mine alone!

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.750
Stop this, Mom!

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:04.240
I won't go away, and I won't let you go.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.950
You will never get away from me!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.350
Damn it.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:22.730
This is bad.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:24.060
There's no end to them.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.130
What are you doing?!

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:34.260
I told you to keep your impedance stable!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:37.950
What do we do?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.020
Activating Limited Mode.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.600
Removing all limiters.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.800
He's back!

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.310
Heavy.

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.650
Onee-chan!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.000
Onee-sama?

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.630
Please, no.

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:38.510
Onee-chan.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.220
Dr. Salt!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:05.470
What are you doing?

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:08.730
I'll cover Pure Illusion in another layer.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.140
Another?

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.460
Salt-san!

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.850
Activate it.

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:29.880
What now?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.780
Stop it, Mimi!

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:35.050
Don't be mean to Cocona!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.840
What? This is my affection.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.200
A mother's love.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.810
It's all for Cocona.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.190
Mom!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.640
Cocona... Cocona...

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:46.850
My dear Cocona.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.480
Let me have a better look at your face!

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:57.200
Mom!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:07:58.660
Ow!

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.220
I'm sorry!

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.520
You raised your hand 
against your own mother?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.070
Bad girl!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.370
Come here, Cocona.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.420
I'll scold you lots!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.840
Scary...

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:28.340
I'm getting chills.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.520
I wanna go home.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:37.800
Who's there?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:39.550
Stay out!

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.580
I'm telling you to stay away!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.220
Stay out!

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.570
Why are you here?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.690
To atone.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.400
Salt-san!

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.040
I'll stop it at once!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:16.600
After being so indecisive, 
now you decide to get in my way?

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:17.860
That's right.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.860
And I'm not about to beg for forgiveness.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.520
Always doing whatever you want!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.950
You're despicable!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.290
Go away!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.940
Get lost!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.420
Salt!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.420
Salt-san...

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:47.810
Mimi!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.270
It's been too long, Salt.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.030
I hate being kept waiting, you know.

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.410
Why?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.760
Why won't any of you understand?

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.100
I was only...

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:11.170
doting on Cocona, my daughter!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.340
What now?

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:15.920
Yayaka!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.000
Who are you?

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:31.850
Mimi!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:34.310
Wait, no! You're not Mimi!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.220
I am Mimi.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.690
A side of hers that you don't know.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:44.370
Even then, Mimi would never 
do anything to make Cocona sad!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.490
And I hate you for this!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.180
So selfish.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.340
Both you and Cocona.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.220
Mom?

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.880
But it's all right now.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.060
I was wrong.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:05.450
I'll destroy everything and rebuild it anew.

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:08.600
I know all about it.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.370
These are the words, right?

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.720
Flip Flapping.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:32.840
Now, let's get rid of all the useless trash.

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:54.080
You're useless, too.

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:55.400
Papika!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:56.960
And you.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.720
Damn it!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.440
Lemme go! I'll...

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.320
Everything should just disappear...

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:08.590
together with me.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.920
Let's believe in our dear friend

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.150
and our wonderful little girl.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:23.960
Papika.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:25.980
Listen, Papika.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:32.890
I actually didn't want to go on adventures.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.120
Cocona?

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:39.060
I wanted to keep drifting through life, 
like a boat riding a current.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.860
Because I was afraid of making 
choices and regretting them.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:50.300
And yet, you took my hand and 
dragged me off that boat.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.620
Well...

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.980
I wanted to go adventuring with you.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.380
I wanted to be with you.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:00.680
I knew it had to be you.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.590
Because you couldn't go 
to Pure Illusion without me?

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:05.910
No!

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.220
That's not it! It was because...

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.400
I love, love, <i>love</i> you!

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.400
You love, love, <i>love</i> me!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:16.390
I'm the same.

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:18.100
I love you.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:21.040
It absolutely <i>has</i> to be you.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.150
Cocona!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.240
I want to see many more worlds with you.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.770
I want to go on many 
more adventures with you.

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:32.920
Yeah.

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:36.720
So... I can't let things end this way.

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.260
Let's go, Papika.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.720
Come to me... everything I have.

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.470
Get her!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.890
Don't you dare...

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.000
...get in the way...

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:10.510
...of our adventure!

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:27.470
Oh, so the one in the wrong was...

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.470
Let us go back

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:34.130
to those days we spent eagerly waiting 
for our daughter to be born.

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:44.410
Mom...

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.800
Switch with me.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:15:00.790
That way, you can go back to 
that day and redo things.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:02.550
Come.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:11.790
I've vowed to never let myself forget 
about the mistakes I've made.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:22.510
You should head back.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:26.430
I'll send those girls home.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:27.980
Forgive me.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:31.370
My, which of your mistakes 
should I forgive you for?

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.130
Forgive me.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.710
It's all right.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:41.330
But you'd better promise me that 
I'll always be your number one.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.470
Damn, where's the exit?

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.530
There!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.170
You guys hurry up, too!

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.390
Mom!

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.090
Don't worry about me.

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.400
Go back to your rightful place.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.150
But I finally got to see you!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.770
Pure Illusion will continue to exist.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:12.160
So this isn't goodbye.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:17.660
Cocona, walk down the path you 
choose with your head held high.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.920
I'll always be watching over you.

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:22.260
Mom!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.670
I've got this.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.560
Papika!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.230
<i>It's time for LIE News.</i>

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.870
<i>We start with breaking news 
on the traffic accident...</i>

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.760
Good morning, Cocona-chan.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.750
Sayuri-san?

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:03.720
You need to take it easy for now.

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:08.510
Where's Papika?

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.470
I need to go get Papika!

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.220
She's still in Pure Illusion, so I—

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.830
Let's have breakfast first.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:21.020
You should eat something.

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.220
We can talk after that.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.900
Would you have preferred rice instead?

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:30.900
Please tell me.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.510
Why won't you say anything?

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.900
Stay calm and don't freak out.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.290
We don't know for sure yet, but...

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.190
Huh? Why won't it work?

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.450
Can this really be allowed to happen?!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.540
This is the universe's greatest loss.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.360
Humanity has lost its path to the future.

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:23.370
Hands off the
powerful PC!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:23.370
Currently
Monitoring
Pure Illusion!!!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.940
I tried 41 different monitoring methods,

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.640
but I didn't once detect Pure Illusion's waves.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.020
That means, due to the 
loss of all the fragments,

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:20.140
Pure Illusion is now 
forever beyond our reach!

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.370
You could say our research has been 
set back ten—no, a million years!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.990
What do you mean, loss?

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:27.380
Weren't you listening?

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:30.880
I said nobody can go to 
Pure Illusion anymore!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.670
It's a crying shame!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:38.390
Nurse's Office

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:37.910
Yayaka!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:39.820
What's wrong?

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:43.950
Oh, if you're worried about Uexkull, 
I've got him at home.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.980
Take me to Pure Illusion!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:48.210
I told you before.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.190
It won't work with the two of us.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.700
It doesn't have to be with me!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.600
Go with the twins and bring Papika—

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.290
It's impossible now.

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.380
I tried it over and over again.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.120
We've lost the amorphous.

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.450
There's nothing we can do.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.870
How am I supposed to believe that?!

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.760
Then just see for yourself.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.520
If that scar is gone...

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:32.470
No!

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.630
Papika?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:44.080
What are you doing?

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:46.170
Where have you been?

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:47.410
How'd you...

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:50.830
I got separated from you, 
so I was with Mimi.

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:52.760
Separated?

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.460
You disappeared.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.990
Sniff, sniff, sniff.

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:06.670
Then, this is...

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.170
Let's head back, Cocona.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.970
Why didn't you come for me sooner?

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.710
I was busy eating sweets with Mimi.

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:26.490
Are you crying, Cocona?

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:28.990
Cocona.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:35.370
Next time you run off without 
telling me, I'll really let you have it!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.690
Flip Flapping!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.930
Do you know where the exit is?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.070
That way.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.880
Why do you never take anything seriously?

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.030
But...

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.350
Let's go together, Cocona.

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.380
Yeah, Papika!

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:39.060
The End
